      "text": "1 KB  = 10^3 bytes       (thousand)\n1 MB  = 10^6 bytes       (million)\n1 GB  = 10^9 bytes       (billion)\n1 TB  = 10^12 bytes      (trillion)\n1 PB  = 10^15 bytes",
      "fontSize": 39.58476060970002,
